# Keep every text file LF in the repository and in every checkout.
# The student VM runs Linux, and a CRLF in a shell script (for example
# lab2/.devcontainer/init-firewall.sh) breaks it with "bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
